  "description": "Public site for the WA.Core Blazor UI: the landing page signed-out visitors see in front of the intranet (the \"Public Page\" of wa-phoenix, Serenity pack): header, hero, services cards from an FM view with workflow booking, about, benefits, call to action, contact and footer, the sections being editable HTML files under FM/_PUBLICCONTENT. Works with every theme (SI.WA.UI.Sneat, SI.WA.UI.960, SI.WA.UI.Aether, SI.WA.UI.SB2, SI.WA.UI.Material3): its CSS is scoped to the public page, the login and the booking dialogs stay the theme's. Built on SI.WA.UI.Core.",
