  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 -- The login page and the booking redirect to login honour the PathBase (IIS_AppName). Version aligned with the other SI.WA.UI packages. Requires SI.WA.UI.Core 1.5.0. 1.3.0 -- No functional change; released with the other SI.WA.UI packages on top of SI.WA.UI.Core 1.3.0. 1.1.0 -- No functional change; released with the other SI.WA.UI packages (one version for the whole family) on top of SI.WA.UI.Core 1.1.0 (AI providers and encrypted API keys moved to the WA_AiSettings table).",
